   "मा च॑ रिषदुपस॒त्ता ते॑ अग्ने ब्र॒ह्माण॑स्ते य॒शस॑ः सन्तु॒ मान्ये"
  ],
  "lines_iast": [
   "saṃ ce̱dhyasvā̭gne̱ pra ca̭ bodhayaina̱mucca̭ tiṣṭha maha̱te saṷbhagāya",
   "mā ca̭ riṣadupasa̱ttā tḙ agne bra̱hmāṇa̭ste ya̱śasa̭ḥ santu̱ mānye"
  ],
